{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"why\": \"整体：C2把放开去爱、更加舍不得、怕变成催促而收住这几个心理环节接得最完整，既保留了前面的心理基础，也能解释这一段的情绪变化。keep：C1最完整地保留了关心对方、替对方高兴、付出本身带来满足、不计较多少以及不怕显得更在乎等实质内容，虽然有重复；C2次之，C3对自己是否在对方心里特别的表述不够明确。cover：C2明确写出更舍不得这一刻、热切起来又怕变成催促，能解释B1的迫切、B2的情绪冲高与收住、B3的想抓紧以及B4的不舍。lean：C3删去了C2中热切起来这一层额外推进，直接从更舍不得当下转到怕给对方压力，心理步骤更紧凑；C1则在付出带来快乐这一点上重复表达。plain：C2的怕成了催促、只好收住一点，像一个人在讲自己当时的顾虑和克制；C3的热情便收了回来稍显概括，C1的热情到了最盛处也略带对音乐走势的描述感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "47ea751e-59e2-40bf-97ab-4acec7fb2bd5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225931018097Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:01:24.202492+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb4abc8bf5af5ea803bf1ae342fa17866a559868a79a6892b15f21879a859af4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc49